{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49419","headline":"麦秀两岐 · 和凝","name":"麦秀两岐","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"凉簟铺斑竹，鸳枕竝红玉。\n脸莲红，眉柳绿。\n胸雪宜新浴，淡黄衫子裁春縠，异香芬馥。\n羞道交回烛，未惯双双宿。\n树连枝，鱼比目。\n掌上腰如束，娇娆不争人拳局，黛眉微蹙。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"和凝","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49419.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49419","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}